You can make your config file look like whatever you want it to.  You are
restricted to use a vi-like editor, however, but you only need to learn a
few commands (e.g. 'a', 'i', 'x', ESC, ':wq') to create your file.

You can copy whatever config file you use at home, or look at other
players' files here:
http://alt.org/nethack/rcfiles/

If you use IRC, you can join #nethack on freenode.net, where a bot
announces every death.

